# Trading safety

- Default IBKR port is paper (`7497`). Live ports (`7496`, `4001`) are **not** blocked by code — never assume they are.
- `POST /api/webhooks/tradingview` **executes** through OrderManager → RMS → OMS → IBKR when wired. It is not capture-only.
- Do not invent flatten-all / kill-switch / pause HTTP APIs; they are not in the routers.
- Do not treat `Execution_System_Architecture.md` or the Postman guide as the current API or process layout.
- Prefer `app/AGENTS.md` + `app/docs/` for current behavior. See `app/docs/safety.md` and `app/docs/gaps.md`.
